  "source": "one-continuous-master",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-01",
      "text": "After swimming through the night, Pinocchio reached the Island of Busy Bees.",
      "start": 0.267,
      "end": 5.27
    },
    {
      "id": "line-02",
      "text": "A helpful Dolphin warned that the Terrible Shark hunted in those waters.",
      "start": 5.27,
      "end": 10.457
    },
    {
      "id": "line-03",
      "text": "In the busy town, nobody would give food to an able beggar.",
      "start": 10.457,
      "end": 14.846
    },
    {
      "id": "line-04",
      "text": "Each person offered a meal only if Pinocchio completed honest work.",
      "start": 14.846,
      "end": 19.95
    },
    {
      "id": "line-05",
      "text": "Hunger finally persuaded him to carry a woman's heavy water jug.",
      "start": 19.95,
      "end": 25.232
    },
    {
      "id": "line-06",
      "text": "She rewarded him with a generous meal and his favorite candy.",
      "start": 25.232,
      "end": 29.831
    },
    {
      "id": "line-07",
      "text": "Pinocchio then recognized the woman as the Blue Fairy.",
      "start": 29.831,
      "end": 33.724
    },
    {
      "id": "line-08",
      "text": "She had grown into a motherly figure while he remained a puppet.",
      "start": 33.724,
      "end": 38.567
    },
    {
      "id": "line-09",
      "text": "He promised to attend school, work hard, and respect her guidance.",
      "start": 38.567,
      "end": 43.641
    },
    {
      "id": "line-10",
      "text": "Classmates mocked him at first, but Pinocchio continued studying.",
      "start": 43.641,
      "end": 49.079
    },
    {
      "id": "line-11",
      "text": "His effort soon made him one of the strongest students.",
      "start": 49.079,
      "end": 52.894
    },
    {
      "id": "line-12",
      "text": "The Fairy suggested that good habits could eventually make him a real boy.",
      "start": 52.894,
      "end": 58.73
    },
    {
      "id": "line-13",
      "text": "Several lazy classmates resented the change and planned to distract him.",
      "start": 58.73,
      "end": 64.102
    },
    {
      "id": "line-14",
      "text": "They claimed that the Terrible Shark had appeared near the beach.",
      "start": 64.102,
      "end": 68.672
    },
    {
      "id": "line-15",
      "text": "Hoping for news about Geppetto, Pinocchio forgot the school-day promise.",
      "start": 68.672,
      "end": 73.566
    },
    {
      "id": "line-16",
      "text": "He followed the boys toward the sea and another dangerous test.",
      "start": 73.566,
      "end": 78.96
    }
  ],
